{"version":1,"content":"<p>Xbox行政總裁Asha Sharma表示，《GTA6》已經創下微軟商店及Xbox商店歷史上的遊戲預購紀錄。此次公佈的成績僅對應微軟平台，目前尚未披露具體預購套數。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585856.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T22:48:21.847784+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T22:29:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T22:41:41.006053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T22:41:41.006053+00:00","content_hash":"ad9f386c89a6212b216987000a8a0c842a261151c28274941f62767dffad0aab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}